    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "A child’s pool is in the shape of a cylinder with radius $1.2\\text{ m}$ and depth $20\\text{ cm}$. Calculate the volume of the pool in litres, correct to the nearest litre.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$905\\text{ L}$",
      "worked": "The depth is $20\\text{ cm}=0.2\\text{ m}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}V&=\\pi r^2h\\\\V&=\\pi\\times1.2^2\\times0.2\\\\V&=0.288\\pi\\text{ m}^3\\\\V&=288\\pi\\text{ L}\\\\V&\\approx905\\text{ L}\\end{align*}$$\nThe pool holds $905\\text{ L}$, correct to the nearest litre.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
